I go by my regular bus.
I get down at the main junction.
There is a lot of crowd here.
I look around.
Where is the other bus stop?
I do not know.
There is a fruit vendor on the road.
I go towards the fruit vendor.
I ask him, "Brother, namaskar."
"Where is the South Mumbai bus stop?"
He points ahead.
He says, "Madam, you go straight here."
"Then turn left towards the big intersection."
"The bus stop is there."
"Thank you, brother," I say.
I walk straight.
Then I go left towards the big intersection.
